<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns:scr="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Scripting.Expressions;assembly=Bonsai.Scripting.Expressions"
                 xmlns:dev="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Devices;assembly=OpenRigs.Devices"
                 xmlns:vc="clr-namespace:CoenQcCalibrateValve;assembly=Extensions"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>The spouts during a calibration or a delivery, so the drops land as in a session (Pip, 10 Nov 2026). On a rig whose rig.yml has a lick spout stage (RigConfigs' stepperDriver), Stage runs the lab's stage piece, OpenRigs.Devices LickSpoutStage (StepperDriver-A and -B): it homes every motor and moves the spouts in, to calibration\LickSpoutPositions\&lt;SubjectId&gt;.csv beside rig.yml or else rig.yml's lickSpoutDefaultPosition. SubjectId here is _valve-calibration_, never a file, since a calibration is no mouse's, so the spouts go to lickSpoutDefaultPosition. Once that move has had its time, both radial (in/out) axes go to SpoutsForwardSteps from home (0: they stay in), and SpoutsReady once that move has had its time too. Once the DoneSubjectName subject ends, DoneCommand moves the stage. On a rig without a stage, SpoutsReady at once and nothing moves: a QC workflow also runs on boxes, and a workflow's graph is fixed, so the piece runs only behind this condition. Needs the RigConfigs, RigConfigDirectory, RigFile (OpenRigs.Devices ReadLabRig), ControlEvents, PathPrefix, HarpClockSet, ReadyStages and SpoutsReady subjects, and the SpoutStepSize parameter on ExperimentControl.</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
        <Name>Stage?</Name>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Expression>it.StepperDriver != null &amp;&amp; it.StepperDriver.Count &gt; 0</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="SpoutsForwardSteps" />
        <Property Name="DoneSubjectName" />
        <Property Name="DoneCommand" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
        <Name>Stage</Name>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="StringProperty">
                <Value>_valve-calibration_</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject">
              <Name>SubjectId</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Devices:LickSpoutStage.bonsai" />
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>LickSpoutStage.Target</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="vc:WaitForMove" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="RadialSteps" DisplayName="SpoutsForwardSteps" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="vc:SpoutsForward">
                <vc:RadialSteps>0</vc:RadialSteps>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>LickSpoutStage.Target</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="vc:WaitForMove" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="BooleanProperty">
                <Value>true</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>SpoutsReady</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="Name" DisplayName="DoneSubjectName" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>UNMAPPED</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:TakeLast">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="Command" DisplayName="DoneCommand" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="dev:ToLickSpoutCommand">
                <dev:Command>SpoutsIn</dev:Command>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>LickSpoutStage.Commands</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="6" To="8" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="13" To="14" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="14" To="15" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="15" To="17" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="16" To="17" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="17" To="18" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="18" To="19" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
        <Name>NoStage?</Name>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Expression>it.StepperDriver == null || it.StepperDriver.Count == 0</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="BooleanProperty">
          <Value>true</Value>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
        <Name>SpoutsReady</Name>
      </Expression>
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="1" To="3" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source2" />
      <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
